### 1. Créer une station → 201
POST http://localhost:8081/api/stations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "Tunis-Carthage", "ville": "Tunis", "latitude": 36.851, "longitude": 10.227, "altitude": 4, "dateInstallation": "2024-03-15" }

### 2. Lister les stations → 200
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stations

### 3. Filtrer par ville → 200
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stations?ville=Tunis

### 4. Détail d'une station → 200
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stations/1

### 5. Station inexistante → 404
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stations/99

### 6. Données invalides → 400
POST http://localhost:8081/api/stations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "", "ville": "Tunis", "latitude": 120, "longitude": 10.2 }

### 7. Modifier une station → 200
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/stations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "Tunis-Carthage", "ville": "Tunis", "latitude": 36.851, "longitude": 10.227, "altitude": 6 }

### 8. Ajouter un capteur → 201
POST http://localhost:8081/api/stations/1/capteurs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "TEMPERATURE", "unite": "°C" }

### 9. Capteur en panne → 200
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/capteurs/1/etat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "etat": "EN_PANNE" }

### 10. Type de capteur inconnu → 400
POST http://localhost:8081/api/stations/1/capteurs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "NEIGE", "unite": "cm" }

### 11. Supprimer (désactiver) une station → 204
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/stations/1

### 12. Vérifier la suppression logique → "active": false
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stations/1